   <media:title>Learn How to Knit with Lion Brand InstaKnit Yarn!</media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/MimGhN4tx8U?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i2.ytimg.com/vi/MimGhN4tx8U/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>This video teaches beginners how to knit using Lion Brand InstaKnit yarn. Viewers will learn how to cast on using Lion Brand InstaKnit yarn, and how to create the knit stitch. Casting on is much easier with InstaKnit because it has pre-made loops that you just slide onto your knitting needle. Then, with the help of simple and clear instructions, viewers learn how to begin knitting, as well as bind off and weave in the ends. Beginners will learn how to cast on, knit rows of stitches and bind off, which is all that's needed for knitting simple scarves, hats, potholders, dishcloths and more.</media:description>
